<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Starbucks reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Starbucks reinstated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Friday it reinstated coverage of Starbucks Corp with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Earnings estimates are $0.22 per share for 1997 and $0.30 per share for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Price target is $48 per share.</p>
<p>-- In research note, analyst Mitchell Speiser called Stabucks &quot;a great company, but fairly valued.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 7/16 to 40-15/16.</p>
</text>
